[{"text":"ToDiracGamma67[exp] substitutes \\frac{1}{2} \\left(1 + \\gamma^5\\right) and \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1-\\gamma^5\\right)\\) by the chirality projectors \\(\\gamma^6\\) and \\(\\gamma^7\\).","anchor":"todiracgamma67"},{"text":"Overview, DiracSubstitute5, DiracGamma, ToDiracGamma67.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"GA[\\[Mu]] . (1/2 + GA[5]/2) . GA[\\[Nu]] ToDiracGamma67[%]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\left(\\frac{\\bar{\\gamma }^5}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^6.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"When the option All is set to True, also standalone \\(\\gamma^5\\) will be replaced","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GA[\\[Mu], 5, \\[Nu]] ToDiracGamma67[%, All -> True]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\bar{\\gamma }^5.\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\mu }.\\left(\\bar{\\gamma }^6-\\bar{\\gamma }^7\\right).\\bar{\\gamma }^{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"}]